  "notes": "ダベる is a casual slang verb that combines hanging out and chatting. It's often written in katakana to emphasize its colloquial nature.\n\nConjugation (godan):\n- ダベらない (negative)\n- ダベ⟦って→って：29146_tte⟧ (te-form)\n- ダベった (past)\n\nSimilar expressions:\n- おしゃべり⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to chat - more neutral)\n- {駄弁|だべ}る (original kanji form, rarely used)\n- ⟦しゃべる→しゃべる：02117_shaberu⟧ (to talk - more general)\n\nTypically used among younger people to describe casual hangout sessions.",
